<div class="flex_column av-2vy8wr-0a8b362fcc4ce923cc45f811e5aa1b8d av_one_full avia-builder-el-9 el_before_av_one_half avia-builder-el-first mobile-text first flex_column_div"><div class="av-special-heading av-m4czso4z-56c5ab3c4212c17b5127a9eebe172d78 av-special-heading-h3 blockquote modern-quote modern-centered avia-builder-el-10 avia-builder-el-no-sibling av-inherit-size"><h3 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">What is NeuroStar TMS Therapy?</h3><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div></div><div class="flex_column_table av-m4h8213l-af95786a7c8e666d1df7548f4d0bedeb sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-m4h8213l-af95786a7c8e666d1df7548f4d0bedeb av_one_half avia-builder-el-11 el_after_av_one_full el_before_av_one_half first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-bottom column-top-margin"><div class="avia-image-container av-m4jibr9q-8fa4b7b60f87f171228099f4ccf1c46b av-styling- avia-align-center avia-builder-el-12 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first" itemprop="image" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="avia-image-container-inner"><div class="avia-image-overlay-wrap"><img alt="NeuroStar Logo. Advanced Therapy for Mental Health in Miami, Florida." class="wp-image-607 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-607 avia_image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="116" itemprop="thumbnailUrl" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" src="../wp-content/uploads/2024/12/NeuroStar-001-300x116.jpg" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2024/12/NeuroStar-001-300x116.jpg 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2024/12/NeuroStar-001.jpg 443w" title="Logo for NeuroStar, Therapy for Mental Health." width="300"/></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m4h81onp-b3a5d0a13a5f155a5cfb6df70a178676" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>NeuroStar uses transcranial magnetic stimulation (TMS) to target key areas of the brain that are underactive in people with depression. Unlike electroconvulsive therapy (ECT), NeuroStar TMS Therapy is a non-invasive treatment that does not involve anesthesia or sedation.</p>
<p>The leading scientific theory suggests that depression is caused by an imbalance in the brain’s neurotransmitters, which are chemical messengers that send signals between brain cells. This therapy aims to correct this imbalance, offering new hope for those <a href="depression-treatment.php">struggling with depression</a>.</p>
</div></section></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-blcx7-8e298f9275f4a7f8d2086b1d99dd1a96 av_one_half avia-builder-el-14 el_after_av_one_half avia-builder-el-last flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-bottom column-top-margin"><div class="avia-image-container av-m4ebrt5y-e0199e7cad5d73623a0abbf2c097d9cb av-styling- avia-align-center avia-builder-el-15 avia-builder-el-no-sibling" itemprop="image" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="avia-image-container-inner"><div class="avia-image-overlay-wrap"><img alt="NeuroStar TMS therapy in Miami at Casa Privee. An innovative approach to neuropsychiatry for treating depression, anxiety, OCD and more." class="wp-image-1288 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-1288 avia_image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="571" itemprop="thumbnailUrl" sizes="(max-width: 797px) 100vw, 797px" src="../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/tms-therapy-miami.webp" srcset="../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/tms-therapy-miami.webp 797w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/tms-therapy-miami-300x215.webp 300w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/tms-therapy-miami-768x550.webp 768w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/tms-therapy-miami-260x185.webp 260w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/02/tms-therapy-miami-705x505.webp 705w" title="NeuroStar TMS therapy in Miami at Casa Privee. An innovative approach to neuropsychiatry for treating depression, anxiety, OCD and more." width="797"/></div></div></div></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 -->
